  "description": "<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\r\n<li><strong>Fence Armor</strong> is a durable and easy-to-install solution to safeguard your fence from harm.</li>\r\n<li>Made from high-quality American galvanized steel, Fence Armor creates a barrier between your fence and external elements, preventing scrapes, dents, and cracks to your posts.</li>\r\n<li>Fence Armor is also resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring long-lasting protection for your fence.</li>\r\n<li>Fence Armor offers post caps and finals that add a decorative touch to your fence and protect the vulnerable end grain of your posts from moisture damage.</li>\r\n<li>Choose from various styles and finishes to match your fence's aesthetics and enhance its overall appearance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Postsaver</strong> rot protection is also available to extend the life of your fence even further.</li>\r\n<li>Postsaver is a patented barrier sleeve that fits over the post before installation, creating a waterproof barrier that prevents rot and decay from moisture, fungi, and insects.</li>\r\n<li><strong>With a 20-year warranty</strong>, Postsaver is a reliable and cost-effective way to protect your fence investment.</li>\r\n<li>Installing Fence Armor, post caps, finals, and Postsaver is a breeze &ndash; no special tools or skills are required.&nbsp; Making it a Signature Series Fence.</li>\r\n<li>Whether you are a homeowner, business owner, or fence contractor, Fence Armor is the intelligent choice for fence protection. Try it today and see the difference!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms: are through Paypal<br><br></p>",
